@startuml
title SD-A02 — Standard checkout runtime
caption To-Be draft | F01–F04 · Backend / Integration
actor Customer as C
boundary "FastAPI behind Next.js relay" as API
control Order
database PostgreSQL as DB
actor Merchant as M
C -> API : Submit authenticated order
API -> Order : Validate snapshot and idempotency
alt Await fee or Cash approval
 Order -> DB : Store pending order; no allocation
 M -> API : Provide fee or accept Cash
 C -> API : Confirm fee when required
else Direct transfer
 Order -> DB : Persist order and hold atomically
end
alt Capacity unavailable at commitment
 API --> C : Conflict and refresh options
else Transfer proof or accepted Cash
 M -> API : Verify funds or record cash on pickup
 API -> DB : Guard transition, update charge and record audit
 DB --> API : Committed
 API --> C : Return authoritative state
end
@enduml
